{"id":"n38813-2-2","stage":5,"title":"기어이 · 最终","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38813-2-2-1","ko":"승규가 장난치다가 이 꽃병을 깨고 말았어요.","zh":"承奎闹着玩，把这个花瓶打碎了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"장난치다가","meaning":"玩耍，嬉戏，调皮","explanation":"장난치다：玩耍，嬉戏，调皮；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"장난치다","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75063","senseId":"2","lemma":"장난치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난치다가","audio":"/audio/d3ca7998ceb5618f7235.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃병을","meaning":"花瓶","explanation":"꽃병：花瓶；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꽃병","audio":"/audio/e02337ff0599809387f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38260","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃병을","audio":"/audio/cdbd331953037b6ee061.mp3"}},{"text":"깨고","meaning":"打碎，砸，毁","explanation":"깨다：打碎，砸，毁；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"깨다","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63406","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨고","audio":"/audio/4ab4b86807eed15cbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"말았어요.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말았어요","audio":"/audio/78b654d601e6db924067.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b7e4917842610b07","term":"장난치다","zh":"玩耍，嬉戏，调皮","audio":"/audio/b7e4917842610b071e16.mp3","entryId":"75063","definition":"没有目的地为了好玩儿而闹得很厉害。","pronunciation":["장난치다"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e02337ff05998093","term":"꽃병","zh":"花瓶","audio":"/audio/e02337ff0599809387f4.mp3","entryId":"38260","definition":"插花用的瓶子。","pronunciation":["꼳뼝"]},{"id":"f06d1a21bd6ecee5","term":"깨다","zh":"打碎，砸，毁","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3","entryId":"63406","definition":"打击坚硬的物体，使之成为碎片。","pronunciation":["깨다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ce7fe6e33a69e95f906.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38813-2-2-2","ko":"그 녀석이 기어이 사고를 쳐 버렸네.","zh":"那家伙最终还是闯祸了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"녀석이","meaning":"家伙（此处带责怪语气）","explanation":"녀석：家伙（此处带责怪语气）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"녀석","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41586","senseId":"1","lemma":"녀석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"녀석이","audio":"/audio/cbe095eba48c92f5c0ed.mp3"}},{"text":"기어이","meaning":"最终，终于","explanation":"기어이：最终，终于","readings":[{"term":"기어이","audio":"/audio/683a15918e37c9732f36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38813","senseId":"2","lemma":"기어이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기어이","audio":"/audio/683a15918e37c9732f36.mp3"}},{"text":"사고를","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"2","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고를","audio":"/audio/56f8e1f5684c2cd70aa0.mp3"}},{"text":"쳐","meaning":"搞，干","explanation":"치다：搞，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"22","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쳐","audio":"/audio/67f68907535c3fdeaceb.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸네.","meaning":"完","explanation":"버리다：完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸네","audio":"/audio/a9df2f51a116788ca27d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"0e723d29b157aa0f","term":"녀석","zh":"家伙（此处带责怪语气）","audio":"/audio/0e723d29b157aa0fccf9.mp3","entryId":"41586","definition":"家伙（此处带责怪语气）","pronunciation":["녀석"]},{"id":"683a15918e37c973","term":"기어이","zh":"最终，终于","audio":"/audio/683a15918e37c9732f36.mp3","entryId":"38813","definition":"到最后。","pronunciation":["기어이"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"给别人带来损害或问题的坏事。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"搞，干","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"欺骗或折磨别人，或指做不好的举动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/au